        <mxCell id="AxMJYLDhyEEIzwlxaINQ-13" value="&lt;div&gt;## Event-Confirmed REST Pattern&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;| Step | Description |&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;|------|-------------|&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;| 1 | `POST /api/v1/collections/...` with optional `Notification=&amp;lt;string&amp;gt;` |&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;| 2 | Request is forwarded internally with `traceId = {userId}-{action}-{timestamp}` |&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;| 3 | Event published via RabbitMQ |&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;| 4 | Persist layer attaches batch, stores trace, emits status |&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;| 5 | Client receives status via NotificationService hook |&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;| 6 | If `status=failure`, optional query `Notification=...` may be provided |&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;container=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
